## 2. Valid Subarrays With Matching Sum Digits
- **Your Approach:** Sliding window intuition.  
- **Lagging:** Tried greedy shrink; digit condition not monotonic.  
- **Correct:** Prefix sums → O(1) sum, O(n²) subarrays.  
- **Hook:** *“Prefix sum + digit check.”*

### Dry Run
`nums=[1,100,1], x=1`
| Subarray | Sum | First | Last | Valid? |
|----------|-----|-------|------|--------|
| [1]      | 1   | 1     | 1    | ✅     |
| [1,100]  | 101 | 1     | 1    | ✅     |
| [100,1]  | 101 | 1     | 1    | ✅     |
| [1]      | 1   | 1     | 1    | ✅     |

